    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n107788" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπέρπᾰχ-υς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">υ,</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>exceedingly fat,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
			</span></i><i>Aër.</i><i><span class="en">
				15
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Cat.Ma.</u>
				9
			</span></i>; <i>very thick,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πλῆθος ὑ.,</span> of <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πτισάνη,</span>
